sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as System Admin
    participant Docker as Docker CLI
    participant Container as ChromaDB Container
    participant Volume as Persistent Volume
    participant Network as Bridge Network

    Admin->>Docker: docker-compose up -d
    Docker->>Container: Create container from image
    Docker->>Volume: Create/mount chroma_data volume
    Docker->>Network: Create bridge network

    Container->>Container: Initialize with env vars
    Container->>Volume: Mount /chroma/chroma
    Container-->>Docker: Container started on port 8000

    Docker-->>Admin: ✅ ChromaDB running at localhost:8000

    Note over Container,Network: Runtime — serves VectorStore requests
    loop Continuous operation
        Network->>Container: ChromaClient JS SDK calls
        Container->>Volume: Read/write persistent data
        Container->>Container: Process vector operations (HNSW index)
        Container-->>Network: Responses (collections, query results)
    end

    Admin->>Docker: docker-compose down
    Docker->>Container: Stop container
    Container->>Volume: Flush pending writes
    Container-->>Docker: Container stopped
    Docker-->>Admin: ✅ ChromaDB stopped (data persisted in volume)
